01:29:52.130 --> 01:29:55.090
with a three to four hour session

01:29:55.090 --> 01:30:00.090
where everybody's able to individually log into a testbed

01:30:00.790 --> 01:30:05.250
along the lines of what the demo from RMIT was showing.

01:30:05.810 --> 01:30:07.650
And each one of you would play a role,

01:30:07.650 --> 01:30:09.550
for example, in this biosecurity space,

01:30:09.550 --> 01:30:10.890
somebody might be the vets,

01:30:10.890 --> 01:30:14.810
somebody might be the jurisdictions, Queensland,

01:30:14.810 --> 01:30:17.290
somebody might be Northern territory,

01:30:17.290 --> 01:30:19.490
so somebody might be the commonwealth,

01:30:19.490 --> 01:30:23.810
somebody might be operations personnel.

01:30:23.810 --> 01:30:25.690
And you would start to push data

01:30:25.690 --> 01:30:28.450
and publish data between each other

01:30:28.450 --> 01:30:30.530
and watch it show up on your laptop

01:30:30.530 --> 01:30:33.490
and then get pushed to somebody else

01:30:33.490 --> 01:30:37.100
