01:30:37.100 --> 01:30:38.580
That seems to work really well,

01:30:38.580 --> 01:30:40.100
the penny drops for people

01:30:41.260 --> 01:30:44.020
when that kind of activity happens.

01:30:44.020 --> 01:30:47.020
