Yeah, so it's like, I'll read my answer.

01:38:24.670 --> 01:38:27.550
It's like, you know how when two organizations

01:38:27.550 --> 01:38:30.230
want to share data, they usually spend month

01:38:30.230 --> 01:38:33.310
on lawyers, emails, and one of agreements

01:38:33.310 --> 01:38:36.190
and then do all again from the scratch

01:38:36.190 --> 01:38:37.910
with the next partner.

01:38:37.910 --> 01:38:40.830
A dataspace is fixed that by splitting the job

01:38:40.830 --> 01:38:42.070
into two parts.

01:38:42.070 --> 01:38:43.630
First, there's a rulebook.

01:38:43.630 --> 01:38:46.470
That's just a group of organizations sitting down once

01:38:46.470 --> 01:38:49.630
and agreeing the rules, who's allowed to join.

01:38:50.790 --> 01:38:53.470
What you are allowed to do with the data.

01:38:53.470 --> 01:38:55.790
What happened if someone break the rules?

01:38:55.790 --> 01:38:57.510
It's written by people.

01:38:57.510 --> 01:39:00.670
It's about the trust and law,

01:39:00.670 --> 01:39:04.950
and it's only have to be agreed one.

01:39:04.950 --> 01:39:06.350
Then there's a connector.

01:39:07.270 --> 01:39:10.070
That's the piece of software each organization's run.

01:39:10.070 --> 01:39:12.030
When someone actually asks for data,

01:39:12.030 --> 01:39:14.310
the connector automatically check the rules.

01:39:14.310 --> 01:39:16.150
The group already agreed.

01:39:17.350 --> 01:39:20.390
Is this person allowed to see this?

01:39:20.390 --> 01:39:24.630
Are they using it for a permanent purpose

01:39:24.630 --> 01:39:28.430
and only lets the exchange happen if the answer is yes.

01:39:28.430 --> 01:39:31.190
So the human agreed with the rules up front

01:39:31.190 --> 01:39:35.950
and the software enforce them every time automatically.

01:39:35.950 --> 01:39:39.270
You agreed once and then sharing become repeatable.

01:39:39.270 --> 01:39:41.430
You don't negotiate from the scratch

01:39:41.430 --> 01:39:44.030
with every new partner.

01:39:44.030 --> 01:39:48.160
That's the whole idea.

01:39:48.160 --> 01:39:50.080
Yeah, so I liked,

