01:40:32.560 --> 01:40:35.120
So governance before technology,

01:40:35.120 --> 01:40:37.720
a dataspace is a social and technical framework

01:40:37.720 --> 01:40:40.320
for finding, sharing and using data.

01:40:40.320 --> 01:40:42.040
For this to function there needs to be trust

01:40:42.040 --> 01:40:45.360
between participants and trust of the system.

01:40:45.360 --> 01:40:47.200
This trust is developed through strong rules

01:40:47.200 --> 01:40:49.160
and policies being adopted.

01:40:49.160 --> 01:40:51.720
Therefore governance comes before technology.

